# Internationalization

Authoritative: `standards/I18N.md`, `i18n/ADAPTER.md`.

- Locales: `de-DE` (initial product language), `en-US`; keys must exist in both.
- No hardcoded user-facing strings (errors, a11y labels, notifications included).
- Locale-aware dates, numbers, units; UTC storage.
- RTL-safe layouts; language independent of measurement preference.
- Legal copy: separate keys + legal-review status metadata when introduced.
- CI fails on missing keys or placeholder mismatches (`npm run validate:i18n`).
